+ * interrupt path and the 4 KiB page setup; every board fact below is the
+ * one of the selected board.
+ *
+ * Board selection:
+ *   A5_BOARD_A5XELTE    Galaxy A5 (2016), Exynos 7580
+ *   A5_BOARD_DREAMLTE   Galaxy S8, Exynos 8895
+ *   A5_BOARD_EXYNOS990  Galaxy S20 family, Exynos 990   (default)
